1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:08,130
Grandfather

2
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:13,060
City is entering autumn.

3
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:16,930
Sky is clear blue high up.

4
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:23,830
Air gradually becomes cool pleasant.

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,630
This year, I will go to school.

6
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:54,160
Grandfather leads me to buy notebooks, choose pens, guides me how to cover notebooks, stick labels, grind ink and teaches me first letters.

7
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:11,560
One morning, grandfather takes me to school. School at end of summer is quiet.

8
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:32,860
Grandfather leads me to visit classrooms, he also lifts me on hand, lets me try tapping on school drum's rough surface.

9
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:48,100
Morning drum sound that day echoes in my school life afterwards.

10
00:01:49,130 --> 00:02:02,900
Before gate of elementary school, I was lucky to have grandfather - "first teacher" of me.

